  "description": "Ma Hyeon-A, who shows off her luxury brand on SNS, says she is a wealthy girl but in reality she lives in a shabby apartment infested with cockroaches. She meets Ji-Yeong, who is being bullied at a transfer school following her father who is changing jobs, and Hyeon-A gives her a little kindness. Then, Ji-Yeong accidentally finds out her own reality, not her fake appearance on SNS. Ji-Yeong wants Hyeon-A to be her best friend as she keeps the secret. Is Ji-Yeong a good best friend or an object of fear of excessive obsession?\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
